// Hot batch 240: fifty-nine- and sixty-instruction functions no route reaches, written by hand from `tools.disasm` and
// verified by synthetic cases (pointer-to-member calls, timestamp checks, physics steps and handle-guarded calls).
// No names: none has evidence.
